    "description": "Flagship reasoning model for complex software engineering, deep mathematical and scientific problem solving, and autonomous multi-step agents. The default synchronous max output is 65,536 tokens; long decode can continue up to 1,048,576 tokens minus the input. Standard price is $4 input, $20 output, and $0.20 implicit cache read per 1M tokens. Also supports code execution, computer use (preview), search grounding, URL context, and file search.",
